# Deferred: profile header typography

**Status:** Parked. Revisit later for branding consistency. Do not change unless the user asks.

## Current baseline

- **Own profile** header text uses **serif** (`design: .serif`) for display name, bio, location, action-tile captions, style tags, and wardrobe selector label.
- **Other-user profile** display name uses **default system** `.title2.weight(.semibold)`; action buttons use system fonts.
- Style tags (`ProfileStyleTagsRow`) already use serif caption (shared component; mainly shown on own profile placeholders today).

## When revisiting

